Reload the page, press play on the video, and give the stream a few seconds to buffer. Then reopen the extension popup.

**The player button does not show**
Confirm you are on a supported 321Tube video page and the player wrapper has rendered. A page refresh usually fixes this.

**The download fails or stops mid-way**
Verify your internet connection and retry. Longer videos may need extra processing time through the offscreen pipeline.

**Only one format is available**
Quality options depend entirely on what the source exposes. Some pages provide just a single stream.

**The extension asks me to sign in**
Activate with your email address. The trial includes 3 free downloads after activation.

