### Do I need to press play first?

In most cases, yes. The majority of video pages withhold the actual stream until the player scripts execute and buffering begins.

### Does it use a remote downloader server?

No. Detection and download processing happen entirely inside the browser extension. Only authentication and update checks reach out to SERP and GitHub endpoints.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'draft', '2026-05-03', 0, 'legacy-json-migration-v1', 'pornvideodownloaders.com:0326c8acd129b10625ee31c2700d11161f60e21f:35e77a2ae8bbd68c82a3e3a675031eeac224d57050604b548d65d594e567651a:321tube-downloader', '2026-07-11T10:21:19.000Z', '2b2f6d0dface0fb2c003c9a970ef63d507a654ccb1e9b4f4d2853fdef67b4bd5', '2026-07-11T10:21:19.000Z', '2026-07-11T10:21:19.000Z');
