- Open a creator or post page: Go to Coomer.su, Coomer.st, or Coomer.party and load the creator or post page you want to scan.
- Scan and filter assets: Open the extension popup to scan visible posts, then switch between Videos, Images, and Text tabs to review the discovered content.
- Download individually or in bulk: Hit Download Visible for the current tab or save items one at a time, then find your files grouped by creator inside the Downloads folder.

## Reviews

- Best for mixed media pages (5/5): The tabbed popup makes it easy to separate videos from images and text posts, and the bulk download flow saves a lot of time. - Riley Silva
