Zula Cams (zulacams.com) is built on Streamate''s platform, so the Streamate Downloader is fully compatible. Live broadcasts, saved recordings, and video pages on Zula Cams use the same underlying delivery system.

Get the extension installed, visit zulacams.com, open a performer page or video, and use the in-player download button or popup to choose quality and begin. Live streams are captured in real time until you stop. Saved videos download as complete MP4 files. Everything processes locally on your device.

