- Visit Zula Cams: Navigate to zulacams.com.
- Capture or download: Use the player button, popup, or context menu.
- Save: Monitor progress and find the MP4 in your downloads folder.

## Reviews

- Seamless on Zula Cams (5/5): Same Streamate tech underneath. The extension just works automatically. - Jordan Lee
- Quality capture (4.9/5): Live capture and VOD downloads both work flawlessly. - Priya Sharma
- Private workflow (4.8/5): Everything processes locally. No external server involvement. - Liam O''Brien

