DreamCam gives you no option to download anything. Live shows are temporary by nature, disappearing the moment they end with no way to revisit them. DreamCam Downloader lets you record live public streams and save available recordings so you have permanent copies.

Visit a live room or recording page on DreamCam, and the extension detects the available stream. Select your preferred quality from the HLS manifest options, press record for live shows, or click download for saved recordings. The extension handles HLS-to-MP4 conversion right inside your browser, and completed files land in a dedicated DreamCam folder on your machine.

VR metadata is preserved when DreamCam provides it, so the saved file carries stereo packing and viewing-angle information for compatible playback. Start with 3 free downloads to evaluate the workflow, then upgrade for unlimited access.

## Why It Exists

- Capture live DreamCam public streams before they end and vanish permanently.
- Download available recordings as MP4 files for reliable offline playback.
- Preserve VR metadata when DreamCam exposes stereo packing and viewing-angle data.
- Process everything locally in your browser with no external server involvement.

## Key Features

- Live public stream capture with start/stop controls and elapsed-time tracking for DreamCam model pages
- VOD recording downloads with quality selection and automatic MP4 conversion
- HLS master playlist parsing and DreamCam API integration for comprehensive quality detection
- VR metadata preservation including stereo packing, frame format, and viewing-angle details when exposed
- In-page download button placed directly on the DreamCam player for quick access
- Quality selector listing available HLS renditions sorted by resolution
- Built-in download manager with progress tracking, segment counts, and cancel controls
- Right-click context menu entry for faster capture starts from any supported page
- Auto-saves finished files into a dedicated DreamCam folder inside Downloads
- Cross-browser support for Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Brave, Opera, Whale, and Yandex on desktop

## How It Works

- Install the extension: Set up DreamCam Downloader in your browser and verify your email through the secure OTP process to activate 3 free downloads.
- Open a live room or recording: Visit DreamCam and navigate to a public live room for capture or a recording page for VOD downloads.
- Select quality and begin: Use the in-player button, popup, or right-click menu to choose your preferred resolution and start the capture or download.
- Save the finished MP4: Monitor progress through the download manager and find the completed MP4 in your DreamCam downloads folder.

## Reviews

- Smooth capture process (5/5): Recording a DreamCam stream is just start and stop. The MP4 conversion happens seamlessly and the file shows up in the right folder. - Alex Rivera
- VR metadata is a bonus (4.9/5): The fact that it preserves VR camera data means my headset picks up the right settings automatically when I play back locally. - Jordan Nguyen
- Reliable and private (4.8/5): Everything runs on my machine. No external servers, no tracking. The OTP activation was quick and the three trial downloads were enough to convince me. - Sam Okoro

## Platform Support

### Browsers

- Chrome
- Edge
- Firefox
- Brave
- Opera
- Whale
- Yandex

### Operating Systems

- Windows
- macOS
- Linux

### Supported Content

