- notifications: Sends completion and error alerts.

## FAQ

### How do I download a video from EPorner?

Navigate to a video page on EPorner.com, start playback so sources become available, then tap the in-player download button, the extension icon, or the right-click download option. Select your preferred resolution and the extension saves the MP4.

### What quality options are available?

The extension displays all detectable formats from EPorner sources, including API results and page-level media tags. Renditions are sorted by resolution from highest to lowest, and MP4 is prioritized when both MP4 and HLS exist.

### What format are downloads saved in?

All downloads are stored as standard MP4 files. Direct MP4 sources save as-is, while HLS streams are stitched and converted to MP4 within the browser.

### Where are my files saved?

Videos go automatically into an Eporner subfolder within your browser''s default Downloads directory.

### Does this work with live streams?

No. This tool is designed for EPorner video pages and embedded playback, not for live-stream capture workflows.

### Can it bypass DRM or paywalls?

No. The extension only operates on content you can already access and does not bypass DRM, account gates, or paywalls.

### Why isn''t the extension finding my video?

Start playback first so EPorner exposes its source data, then reopen the extension. If detection still does not work, refresh the page and try again.

### Which browsers are supported?

Desktop builds are available for Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Brave, Opera, Whale, and Yandex on Windows, macOS, and Linux. Safari and mobile browsers are not supported.

### Is there a free trial?

Yes. You get 3 free trial downloads after email OTP verification. After that, the product uses a paid subscription for unlimited downloads.

### Is my data private?

