- Use the player download control instead of searching through site markup code
- Organize saved Fapality videos in a purpose-built folder structure

## Troubleshooting

**The download button does not appear on the page.**
Ensure the video has started playing so the media stream is active, then refresh the page and try again.

**The extension popup shows no media detected.**
