Sunporno Downloader is a browser extension that lets you save video media that is available on supported Sunporno video pages. Instead of copying links into external download websites, this tool works right from the tab where you are already watching. It scans the page for active media and shows you the available options for saving locally.

- Identifies available MP4 and HLS video streams from supported Sunporno pages
- Operates directly from the video page open in your browser
- Shows quality choices when multiple resolutions are available
- Saves files through your browser''s standard download mechanism
- Protects your privacy by keeping Sunporno URLs away from third-party download sites

## Why Sunporno Downloader

Sunporno video pages do not always make it obvious how to save a video. Right-clicking might grab a thumbnail, a poster frame, or some other page element rather than the actual video stream. Using external download sites introduces privacy concerns and often results in the wrong file being captured.

Sunporno Downloader keeps everything within your active Sunporno tab. Load the video, let the player start, then use the extension to check for MP4 or HLS stream options. The extension watches for media signals that appear only once the player has started buffering, catching stream URLs that would not be visible otherwise. When downloadable media is found, it presents your options and saves through the browser''s built-in download system.

## Features

- Purpose-built URL matching for sunporno.com and its subdomains
- Examines the active video page for available media signals
- Picks up progressive MP4 and HLS/M3U8 stream candidates
- Quality picker when the page exposes more than one resolution
- Browser-native download workflow for saving files locally
- Organized save folder for keeping downloaded videos tidy
- Lightweight extension that plays nicely with normal browsing
- Keeps current through GitHub Releases updates

## How It Works

1. Install the extension from the latest release.
2. Open Sunporno and go to a supported video page.
3. Start playback so the extension can detect the media.
4. Open the popup or use the on-page controls.
5. Choose the quality option you want.
6. Start the download and wait for the MP4 export to finish.
7. Save the final file locally.

## Step-by-Step Tutorial: How to Download Videos from Sunporno

1. Get the Sunporno Downloader extension from the most recent GitHub release.
2. Fire up your browser and navigate to a Sunporno video page you would like to save.
3. Let the video player load and begin playback if it does not start automatically.
4. Click the Sunporno Downloader icon in your toolbar.
5. The extension will examine the page for available media options.
6. Look through the detected streams and quality levels shown in the popup.
7. Pick the quality option you prefer from the list.
8. Hit the download button and wait for the file to land on your computer.

## Supported Formats

- Input: Progressive MP4 streams and HLS/M3U8 playlists when Sunporno exposes them to the browser
- Output: MP4

Files are saved as MP4 so they play smoothly on standard media players, transfer easily between devices, and store well for long-term archiving.

## Who It''s For

- Sunporno viewers wanting personal offline copies of videos they are authorized to save
- Users who prefer keeping their activity within the browser rather than visiting external download sites
- People who want to pick their preferred quality level for saved videos
- Anyone looking for a browser-native method to save available Sunporno video media

## Common Use Cases

- Save a Sunporno video for personal offline viewing
- Determine whether the current page offers direct MP4 or HLS media
- Avoid routing Sunporno URLs through third-party paste-and-download sites
- Select a practical resolution when several quality options are present
- Keep a copy of videos you have permission to save for later access without needing an internet connection

## Troubleshooting

**The extension cannot find any media on the page.**
Confirm the video player has fully loaded and playback has started. Some stream URLs only become visible once buffering begins.

**The download begins but stops partway through.**
Check your internet connection and try again. If the problem continues, reload the page and restart the video before trying the download once more.

**No quality choices show up.**
Some Sunporno videos may only make a single stream available. The extension shows whatever quality information the page provides.

**The extension icon is not visible on Sunporno pages.**
Make sure the extension is properly installed and enabled in your browser. Try refreshing the Sunporno tab after installation.

**Downloads are landing in the wrong folder.**
Check your browser''s download settings. The extension uses your browser''s default download location unless you configure it differently.

## Trial & Access

- Includes **3 free downloads** so you can test the workflow first
- Email sign-in uses secure one-time password verification
- No credit card required for the trial
