## About Sunporno

Sunporno is an adult video platform hosting user-uploaded and professionally produced content across a wide range of categories. This extension helps viewers save available video media directly from supported Sunporno pages without resorting to external download tools.

## FAQ

### Is Sunporno Downloader available now?

Yes, the extension is live and ready to install. Head to the GitHub Releases page to grab it, and follow the installation steps listed above.

### How do I download a Sunporno video?

Navigate to a Sunporno video page, let the player load the content, then use the extension controls to find and save the available media.

