No. The process is entirely local. All detection and saving happens in your desktop browser, and no data is routed through external services.

### Can it bypass private content, paywalls, or DRM?

No. It is designed exclusively for content you already have access to and are permitted to keep. No access restrictions, paywalls, or DRM protections are circumvented.

