xHamsterLive cam sessions are transient. Performers go live, interact with their audience, and when the session ends the content is typically gone unless a recorded replay surfaces later. This downloader lets you capture live cam sessions in real time, writing the incoming stream directly to an MP4 file on your local device so you keep a permanent offline copy of broadcasts you were present for.

The extension records at whatever quality your browser receives from xHamsterLive. There is no re-encoding, so the original bitrate, resolution, and audio quality are preserved. A heartbeat monitor detects stream interruptions and automatically reconnects when the feed resumes, stitching everything into a single continuous file.

All recording happens locally. No copies go to external servers, and your activity is not visible to performers or other viewers.

## Why It Exists

- Record live xHamsterLive sessions in real time before they end.
- Preserve original stream quality with no re-encoding.
- Automatic reconnection when streams temporarily drop.
- Process everything locally with zero external involvement.

## Key Features

- Real-time live stream recording from xHamsterLive
- Original quality preservation with no re-encoding
- Heartbeat monitor with automatic reconnection
- Single continuous MP4 output from stitched segments
- Local-only recording with no external servers
- Private recording invisible to performers and viewers
- Cross-browser support for desktop browsers

## How It Works

- Install: Add xHamsterLive Downloader.
- Open a live session: Visit any live performer page.
- Record: Start recording through the extension.
- Save: The MP4 saves to your device when recording stops.

## Reviews

- Permanent offline copies (5/5): Stream once, keep forever. Exactly what I needed. - Devon Chang
- Auto-reconnect works great (4.9/5): Stream dropped briefly but the recording continued seamlessly. - Kai Nakamura
- Truly invisible (4.8/5): No trace of recording activity visible to anyone. - Rachel Torres

## Platform Support

