XNXX does not have a download button, leaving ad-filled online converters with redirects and questionable prompts as the only alternative. XNXX Video Downloader provides a cleaner path: a simple browser extension that adds the save option XNXX never built.

Browse to any video on xnxx.com, xnxx3.com, or any mirror site, click the extension icon, and pick the resolution you want. The file saves automatically as a clean MP4. The extension recognizes alternative XNXX domains without extra setup, so it works across the XNXX ecosystem.

Downloads run one at a time for file integrity. Everything processes locally.

## Why It Exists

- Download XNXX videos without ad-riddled converter sites.
- Automatic recognition of XNXX domains and mirrors.
- Save the original MP4 with no re-encoding.
- Process everything locally and privately.

## Key Features

- In-page download controls for XNXX video pages
- Support for xnxx.com, xnxx3.com, video.xnxx.com, and mirrors
- Resolution picker from available quality options
- Original MP4 saving with no re-encoding
- Sequential downloads for integrity
- Local-only processing
- Cross-browser support for Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Brave, and Opera

## How It Works

- Install: Add XNXX Downloader.
- Open a video: Visit any XNXX video on any supported domain.
- Download: Click the icon and choose resolution.
- Save: The original MP4 saves to your device.

## Reviews

- Clean and simple (5/5): No more converter site nightmares. This just works. - Alex Kim
- All domains supported (4.9/5): Works on every XNXX variant without setup. - Sarah Johnson
- Original quality preserved (4.8/5): Downloads the exact source file. - Marcus Chen

## Platform Support

### Browsers

- Chrome
- Edge
- Firefox
- Brave
- Opera

### Operating Systems

- Windows
- macOS
- Linux

### Supported Content

- xnxx.com and mirrors
- Direct MP4 sources

### Not Supported

- Mobile browsers
- Safari

## Privacy and Permissions

Supported regions: Worldwide.

Limitations:
- One download at a time.
- No re-encoding or watermark removal.
- Safari and mobile not supported.

Permissions:
- downloads: Saves MP4 files.
- storage: Stores licence state.
- activeTab: Detects pages.
- scripting: Reads player data.

## FAQ

### How do I download an XNXX video with this extension?

Visit the video on any XNXX domain, click the downloader icon, select your preferred resolution, and wait for the progress bar to finish. The MP4 saves automatically.

### Does it work on alternative domains like xnxx3.com?

Yes. The extension recognises xnxx.com, video.xnxx.com, xnxx3.com, and other mirrors without extra setup.

### Can I download multiple videos at once?

Downloads run one at a time so the file stays intact. Start the next video after the current one completes.

