Downloading XVideos videos with online tools means ads plastered everywhere, downloads that fail halfway through, and error messages that make no sense. XVideos Downloader is a browser extension that replaces all of that with a reliable one-click workflow.

Open any video on xvideos.com, xvideos.es, or any mirror domain, click the download button, and choose your quality. The file saves as a clean MP4. The extension handles the complexity internally so you get a dependable result every time, applying the correct network rules and source detection for the XVideos ecosystem.

Downloads run one at a time for reliability. Everything processes locally.

## Why It Exists

- Download XVideos videos reliably without ad-infested online tools.
- Automatic support for xvideos.com, xvideos.es, and mirrors.
- Save the original MP4 with proper network rule handling.
- Process everything locally.

## Key Features

- In-page download controls for XVideos pages
- Support for xvideos.com, xvideos.es, and mirrors
- Quality picker from available resolutions
- Network rule handling for reliable downloads
- Original MP4 saving
- Sequential downloads
- Local-only processing
- Cross-browser support for Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Brave, and Opera

## How It Works

- Install: Add XVideos Downloader.
- Open a video: Visit any XVideos video on any supported domain.
- Download: Click the icon and choose quality.
- Save: The MP4 saves to your device.

## Reviews

- Actually works (5/5): After years of broken converter sites, this is refreshing. - Amanda Torres
- Mirror support (4.9/5): xvideos.es and other mirrors work perfectly. - Pablo Herrera
- One click done (4.8/5): Click, quality, save. Nothing more needed. - Lisa Wang

## Platform Support

### Browsers

- Chrome
- Edge
- Firefox
- Brave
- Opera

### Operating Systems

- Windows
- macOS
- Linux

### Supported Content

- xvideos.com and mirrors
- Direct MP4 sources

### Not Supported

- Mobile browsers
- Safari

## Privacy and Permissions

Supported regions: Worldwide.

Limitations:
- One download at a time.
- No re-encoding or watermark removal.
- Safari and mobile not supported.

Permissions:
- downloads: Saves MP4 files.
- storage: Stores licence state.
- activeTab: Detects pages.
- scripting: Reads player data.

## FAQ

### How do I download an XVideos video with reliable results?

Navigate to the video on any XVideos domain, click the downloader icon, pick your preferred quality, and let the extension handle the rest. It applies the correct network rules for reliable results.

### Does it work on regional mirrors like xvideos.es?

Yes. The extension supports xvideos.com, xvideos.es, and other official mirrors without extra configuration.

### Can I download multiple videos simultaneously?

Downloads run one at a time so each file completes successfully. Start the next video after the current one finishes.

### Which browsers are supported?

Builds are available for Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Brave, and Opera on Windows, macOS, and Linux desktops.

### Does it remove watermarks or change the file?

No. The downloader saves the original MP4 exactly as XVideos delivers it with no re-encoding or watermark removal performed.

### Is my activity private?

All operations happen locally. The extension only validates your licence and never uploads viewing or download history.

### Is this legal?

DISCLAIMER: We are not attorneys and do not offer legal advice. Laws vary by country and platform. For any legal question please consult a qualified legal professional.

We give you full control over download speeds because we believe users should decide how they use their software.

That said, here are a few widely accepted best practices for safe, responsible downloading:

