INSERT INTO listings (id, site_id, slug, name, description, website, content, entity_type, priority, is_unofficial, is_featured, is_active, status, published_at, display_order, source_kind, source_identity, source_updated_at, checksum, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('lst_da80fb5e4917bb2a6c7ff8ce', 'pornvideodownloaders.com', 'yespornplease-downloader', 'YesPornPlease Video Downloader', 'YesPornPlease aggregates from dozens of sources, making downloads complex. This extension handles it all for you.', 'https://serp.ly/yespornplease-downloader', '## Overview

YesPornPlease aggregates content from many different hosting providers, which makes downloading tricky. Each video comes from a different source with different formats, and generic download tools usually fail. YesPornPlease Downloader identifies the source automatically and delivers a clean MP4 file.

Open a video page on YesPornPlease, click the download button, pick your quality, and the extension resolves the upstream source and saves the file. It handles the varying embed formats and CDN structures behind the scenes so you do not have to troubleshoot each video individually.

Everything processes locally. No external servers involved.

## Why It Exists

- Download from YesPornPlease despite its multi-source aggregation.
- Automatic upstream source resolution across different hosting providers.
- Standard MP4 output with HLS conversion when needed.
- Local processing with no external servers.

## Key Features

- Multi-source resolution for YesPornPlease aggregate content
- Upstream provider detection across different embed formats
- Quality picker from available resolutions
- Direct MP4 and HLS support with conversion
- Local-only processing
- Cross-browser support for Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Brave, and Opera

## How It Works

- Install: Add YesPornPlease Downloader.
- Open a video: Visit any YesPornPlease video page.
- Download: Click the extension and choose quality.
- Save: The MP4 saves to your device.

## Reviews

- Handles every source (5/5): Different providers, different formats, all resolved automatically. - Chris Andersen
- Clean MP4 output (4.9/5): HLS conversion is seamless. - Yuki Tanaka
- No troubleshooting needed (4.8/5): Each video just works regardless of the upstream source. - Mila Novak

## Platform Support

### Browsers

- Chrome
- Edge
- Firefox
- Brave
- Opera

### Operating Systems

- Windows
- macOS
- Linux

### Supported Content

- YesPornPlease video pages
- Content from supported upstream providers

### Not Supported

- Private or DRM content
- Mobile browsers
- Safari

## Privacy and Permissions

Supported regions: Worldwide.

Limitations:
- Some upstream sources may not be supported.
- No DRM or login bypass.
- Safari and mobile not supported.

Permissions:
- downloads: Saves video files.
- storage: Stores preferences.
- activeTab: Detects pages.
- scripting: Reads source data.

## FAQ

### How do I download a video from YesPornPlease?

Navigate to a video page on YesPornPlease.com, click the extension icon or use the right-click download option, select your quality, and the extension resolves the upstream source and saves the MP4.

### Why does YesPornPlease need a specialized downloader?

YesPornPlease aggregates videos from multiple hosting providers, each with different embed formats and CDN structures. The extension resolves these variations so you do not have to troubleshoot each video individually.

### What quality options are available?

The extension lists every resolution the upstream source provides, sorted by quality. When both direct MP4 and HLS are available, MP4 is preferred. HLS streams are converted to MP4 in the browser.

### Does this work with private or DRM content?

No. It is designed for publicly accessible material that you have rights to download. It does not bypass DRM, logins, or paywalls.

### Which browsers are supported?

Builds are available for Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Brave, and Opera on Windows, macOS, and Linux desktops.

### Is my data tracked?

No. All video processing happens locally in your browser. Downloads stay on your device and no usage analytics or content copies are captured.

### Is this legal?

DISCLAIMER: We are not attorneys and do not offer legal advice. Laws vary by country and platform. For any legal question please consult a qualified legal professional.

We give you full control over download speeds because we believe users should decide how they use their software.

That said, here are a few widely accepted best practices for safe, responsible downloading:

- Only download content you created, own, or have explicit permission from the rights holder to access.

- Protect your personal data by respecting platform rules and rate limits with reasonable download speeds to avoid automated abuse systems putting your account at risk.

- Protect your privacy by using a reputable VPN for IP protection before initiating downloads — this is the VPN we recommend & use.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'draft', '2026-05-03', 276, 'legacy-json-migration-v1', 'pornvideodownloaders.com:0326c8acd129b10625ee31c2700d11161f60e21f:35e77a2ae8bbd68c82a3e3a675031eeac224d57050604b548d65d594e567651a:yespornplease-downloader', '2026-07-11T10:21:19.000Z', 'e30daf9608f1b340cd4b63665997fff0016e44649756fb9442a2e8d7ba0c858e', '2026-07-11T10:21:19.000Z', '2026-07-11T10:21:19.000Z');
